  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Each quick menu tab requires a full click to open, but for navigating small buttons, this is a little slow and prone to missclicks. \nIt would be nice to be able to drag click one tab to scrub through each by moving the cursor left/right. This could also be applied to the camera and notification tabs, making the whole UI feel much more smooth and easy to navigate.\n\nBlenders UI as example:\nhttps://youtu.be/SwRuUsYgbno\n\nits also just fun to use :>",
